# Input

```svelte
<script lang="ts" module>
    // we need a certain length here
</script>

<script lang="ts">
    // we need a certain length here
</script>

<style type="scss">
    /* we need a certain length here */
</style>

<!-- this test checks that the matching spans are adjusted after replacing the code, as otherwise it would mess up the snipping -->

```


